        <item>
            <title>5.2.23</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:49:16 +0000</pubDate>
            <link>https://yaprflow.com/</link>
            <sparkle:version>36</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>5.2.23</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Yaprflow 5.2.23

- Keeps Zoom and other conferencing apps at their normal microphone and
  speaker levels while Meeting Notes is recording.
- Preserves accurate speaker separation using Yaprflow's local playback-echo
  detection instead of changing the shared Mac audio route.

Speech recognition remains on-device and raw audio is not saved.
]]></description>
