        </item>
        <item>
            <title>5.2.22</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 16:35:10 +0000</pubDate>
            <link>https://yaprflow.com/</link>
            <sparkle:version>35</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>5.2.22</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Yaprflow 5.2.22

- Prevents meeting capture from unnecessarily lowering the volume of other
  people speaking on the Mac.
- Makes repeated manual update checks safe while another update check is
  already running.
- Hardens audio processing, meeting-note editing, storage, and AI requests so
  unexpected input produces a recoverable error instead of closing the app.

Speech recognition remains on-device and raw audio is not saved.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://m3kx2mv37nzf8tbz.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/updates/5.2.22/07060ab4154e77f41c92/yaprflow-5.2.22-h451wpSbRtfssvHWM0R2foRH17Drlu.dmg" length="480461883" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="wvx67EntgYt//pf4pOvftxsfvJscgQl/2ieok0b6FU8aN7JFO6QlN48IPRONvzehCVH+5Ny16Nu7P3hKqOBuAA=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>5.2.21</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 13:40:34 +0000</pubDate>
            <link>https://yaprflow.com/</link>
            <sparkle:version>34</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>5.2.21</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Yaprflow 5.2.21

- Fixes Auto-paste permission setup so macOS shows the correct prompt and can
  paste completed dictation at the current cursor.
- Keeps the finished text on the clipboard when permission has not yet been
  granted.

Speech recognition remains on-device and raw audio is not saved. Auto-paste
uses macOS permission only to send the standard Paste shortcut to the app you
are currently using.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://m3kx2mv37nzf8tbz.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/updates/5.2.21/636f06238a9ff531cbb6/yaprflow-5.2.21-E2jEJyzcXvXUjh4Qbopce8aWrHihNt.dmg" length="480453346" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="BXz5pxM56Ot7+PnYYegYiyDcyjrNdA+RD6XCn8v7knYNrTFrxsF0MZu4NBk22yqwtsBWREOuN1hpe5DOU9IgCA=="/>
